        "content": "::list = Nil | Cons !x xs\n::Tup  = Tup !a !b\n\nstart = printlist (head (knights 5))\nknights n = doknights n (Cons (Tup 1 1) Nil)\n\ndoknights n qs  = case qs (Nil -> 111) (Cons p ps -> if (length ps + 1 == n * n) (Cons qs Nil) (concat (map (dkaf n qs) (moves n ps p))))\n\ndkaf n qs q = doknights n (Cons q qs)\nmoves n as t = case t (Tup p q -> filter (legal n as) (Cons (Tup (p+1) (q+2)) (Cons (Tup (p+1)(q-2)) (Cons (Tup (p-1)(q+2))\n                      (Cons (Tup (p-1)(q-2)) (Cons (Tup (p+2)(q+1)) (Cons (Tup (p+2)(q-1)) (Cons (Tup (p-2)(q+1)) (Cons (Tup (p-2)(q-1)) Nil)))))))))\n\nlegal n as t = case t (Tup p q -> p >= 1 /\\ n >= p /\\ q >= 1 /\\ n >= q /\\ notmemb as t)\n\nneqtup t1 t2 = case t1 (Tup a1 b1 -> case t2 (Tup a2 b2 -> a1 != a2 \\/ b1 != b2))\nnotmemb xs a = case xs (Nil -> True) (Cons x xs ->  neqtup a x /\\ notmemb xs a)\n\nfilter p xs = case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons a as -> if (p a) (Cons a (filter p as)) (filter p as))\n\nmap f xs = case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons x xs -> Cons (f x) (map f xs))\n\nconcat xss = case xss (Nil -> Nil) (Cons ys yss -> case ys (Nil -> concat yss) (Cons a as -> Cons a (concat (Cons as yss))))\n\nlength xs = case xs (Nil -> 0) (Cons x xs -> 1 + length xs)\n\nprinttup t = case t (Tup a b -> print a <#> print b)\n\nprintlist xs = case xs (Nil -> 0) (Cons x xs -> printtup x <#> printlist xs)\n\nhead xs = case xs (Nil -> 111) (Cons x xs -> x)\n\n"
