        "content": "::list = Nil | Cons !x xs\n\nstart =  queens 11\n\nlength xs = case xs (Nil -> 0) (Cons x xs -> 1 + length xs)\n\nfromto n m = if (n > m) Nil (Cons n (fromto (n+1) m))\n\nqueens n = length (qqueens n n)\n\nqqueens k n = if (n == 0) (Cons Nil Nil) (concat (map (recqq k) (qqueens k (n - 1))))\n\nrecqq k xs = mapfil (safe xs 1) (rcons xs) (fromto 1 k)\n\nsafe xs d x = case xs (Nil -> True) (Cons y ys ->  x != y  /\\ x + d != y /\\ x - d != y /\\ safe ys (d + 1) x)\n\nrcons xs x = Cons x xs\n\nconcat xss = case xss (Nil -> Nil) (Cons ys yss -> case ys (Nil -> concat yss) (Cons a as -> Cons a (concat (Cons as yss))))\n\nmapfil p f xs = case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons a as -> if (p a) (Cons (f a) (mapfil p f as)) (mapfil p f as))\n\nmap f xs = case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons x xs -> Cons (f x) (map f xs))\n"
