        "content": "::list = Nil | Cons !x xs\n::Tup  = Tup !a !b\n\nstart = allsort\nallsort = printlist (Cons (sum (qsorttest 1000)) (Cons (sum (isorttest 600)) (Cons (sum (msorttest 10000)) Nil)))\n\nisorttest n =  (isort (mklist n))\nmsorttest n =  (msort (mklist n))\nqsorttest n =  (qsort (mklist n))\nt7 = printlist (msort (mklist 10000))\n\nlength xs = case xs (Nil -> 0) (Cons x xs -> 1 + length xs)\n\nfromto n m = if (n > m) Nil (Cons n (fromto (n+1) m))\ndownto n m = if (n < m) Nil  (Cons n (downto (n-1) m))\nft n m i =  if (n > m) Nil (Cons n (ft (n+i) m i))\ndt n m i =  if (n < m) Nil (Cons n (dt (n-i) m i))\n\nel n xs = case xs (Nil -> 111) (Cons x xs -> if (n == 0) x (el (n-1) xs))\nfilter p xs = case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons a as -> if (p a) (Cons a (filter p as)) (filter p as))\n\ntake n xs = if (n == 0) Nil (case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons x xs -> Cons x (take (n-1) xs)))\ndrop n xs = if (n == 0) xs (case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons x xs -> drop (n-1) xs))\n\nsumrem xs = case xs (Nil -> 0) (Cons a as -> (a + sumrem as) % 7 )\nsum xs = case xs (Nil -> 0) (Cons a as -> a + sum as)\n\nmap f xs = case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons x xs -> Cons (f x) (map f xs))\n\ninc n = n+1\n\nprintlist xs = case xs (Nil -> 0) (Cons x xs -> print x <#> printlist xs)\n\nmerge xs ys = case xs (Nil -> ys) (Cons a as -> case ys (Nil -> xs) (Cons b bs -> if (a <= b) (Cons a (merge as ys)) (Cons b (merge xs bs))))\n\nfst t = case t (Tup a b -> a)\nsnd t = case t (Tup a b -> b)\n\nappend xs ys = case xs (Nil -> ys) (Cons x xs -> Cons x (append xs ys))\n\nsplit xs = let n = length xs, h = n / 2 in Tup (take h xs) (drop h xs)\n\nmsort xs = let n = length xs, h = n / 2 in if (n < 2) xs (merge (msort (take h xs)) (msort (drop h xs)))\n\nlast xs = case xs (Nil -> 666) (Cons x xs -> case xs (Nil -> x) (Cons y ys -> last xs))\n\ninsert x xs = case xs (Nil -> Cons x Nil) (Cons y ys -> if (x < y) (Cons x xs) (Cons y (insert x ys)))\n\nisort xs = case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons y ys -> insert y (isort ys))\n\nqsort xs = case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons y ys -> append (qsort (filter (kl y) ys)) (Cons y (qsort (filter (gr y) ys))))\nkl x y = y <= x\ngr x y = y > x\n\nmklist n      = mkl 0 n 0\nmkl m n k   = if (k == 10) Nil (mklaf m n k)\nmklaf m n k = if (n > m) (Cons (m * 10 + k) (mkl (m + 1) n k)) (mkl 0 n (k + 1))\n\n\n"
