        "name": "sprimes.cfp",
        "path": "benchmarks/sprimes.cfp",
        "type": "file",
        "ext": ".cfp",
        "size": 1509,
        "isBinary": false,
        "content": "::nat  = Zero | Suc !n\n::list = Nil | Cons !x xs\n\nstart = tonum (el h280 primes)\n\nAdd n m  = case n (Zero -> m) (Suc n -> Suc (Add n m))\n\ntonum n   = case n (Zero -> 0) (Suc n -> tonum n + 1)\nfromnum n = if (n==0) Zero (Suc (fromnum (n - 1)))\n\none    = Suc Zero\ntwo    = Add one one\nfour   = Add two two\neight  = Add four four\nfive   = Suc(Suc (Suc (Suc (Suc  Zero))))\nten    = Add five five\ntwenty = Add ten ten\nforty  = Add twenty twenty\neighty = Add forty forty\nh60    = Add eighty eighty\nh20    = Add eighty forty\nh200   = Add h60 forty\nh280   = Add h200 eighty\n\nPred n         = case n (Zero -> 111)  (Suc n -> n)\nSub m n       = case n (Zero -> m) (Suc n -> case m (Zero -> 123) (Suc m -> Sub m n))\nGt n k        = case n (Zero -> 0) (Suc n -> case k (Zero -> 1)   (Suc k -> Gt n k))\nNeq k m       = case k (Zero -> case m (Zero -> 0) (Suc m -> 1)) (Suc k -> case m (Zero -> 1) (Suc m -> Neq k m))\nel n xs       = case n (Zero -> case xs (Nil -> 111) (Cons a as -> a)) (Suc n -> case xs (Nil -> 111) (Cons a as -> el n as))\n\nMod n m       = if (Gt m n) n (Mod (Sub n m) m)\nnotmodzero x y = Neq (Mod y x) Zero\n\nfrom n         = Cons n (from (Suc n))\n\nprimes          = sieve (from two)\nsieve xs       = case xs (Nil -> 111) (Cons x xs -> Cons x (sieve (filter (notmodzero x) xs)))\nfilter p xs    = case xs (Nil -> Nil) (Cons a as -> if (p a) (Cons a (filter p as)) (filter p as))\ndomain n        = tonum (el n primes)\n\nprintlist xs = case xs (Nil -> 0) (Cons n ns -> print (tonum n) <#> printlist ns)\n\n\n\n"
