        "isBinary": false,
        "content": "// IFL 2016 Paper - Figure 2, 4, 5 & 7\n// Lazy Factorial: parameter n is non-strict.\n// Demonstrates:\n// - Stage 2: lazy tagging of (n - 1)\n// - Stage 3: lambda lifting into helper function facl_1\n// - Stage 4: explicit thunk creation (thunk (facl_1 n)) and eval(n)\n// - Stage 5: dual entry point (facl_lazy vs facl)\n\nstart = facl 6\n\nfacl n =\n  if (n == 0)\n    1\n    (n * facl (n - 1))\n"
