        "content": "// IFL 2016 Paper - Figure 2 & 8\n// Infinite Prime Stream: computes the 1000th prime (7919) or 5000th (48619).\n// Demonstrates infinite lazy stream generation (from), filtering, and indexing (el).\n\n::list = Nil | Cons !x0 x1\n\nstart = el 1000 primes\n\nel !n !xs =\n  case xs\n    (Nil -> nomatch)\n    (Cons x xs -> if (n == 0) x (el (n - 1) xs))\n\nfrom a = Cons a (from (a + 1))\n\nnmz n m = (m % n) != 0\n\nfilter p xs =\n  case xs\n    (Nil -> Nil)\n    (Cons a as -> if (p a) (Cons a (filter p as)) (filter p as))\n\nsieve xs =\n  case xs\n    (Nil -> nomatch)\n    (Cons a as -> Cons a (sieve (filter (nmz a) as)))\n\nprimes = sieve (from 2)\n"
